---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro'
---

<Base
  title="百化分训练器"
  description="行测资料分析·百化分条件反射训练：随机出百分数，目标秒答 1/n，带记忆法解释、计算器和草稿纸。"
>
  <section class="wrap bhf" id="bhfRoot">
    <div class="bhf-head">
      <div>
        <p class="bhf-kicker"><a href="/skills/">← 工具</a> · 行测资料分析</p>
        <h1 class="bhf-title">百化分训练器</h1>
      </div>
      <div class="topacts">
        <button class="icon" id="btnTable" type="button" title="1/n 基础百分表">1/n 表</button>
        <button class="icon" id="btnFull" type="button" title="全屏 / 沉浸模式">全屏</button>
        <button class="icon" id="btnSet" type="button" title="设置">设置</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="lead">
      随机出一个数，把它秒翻成 <b>1/n</b>。答错会告诉你课件里的记忆法；算不过来就打开计算器，
      算完点「提交答案」直接判分。
    </p>

    <div class="stats">
      <div class="st"><span class="k">正确</span><span class="v" id="sRight">0 / 0</span></div>
      <div class="st"><span class="k">连击</span><span class="v" id="sStreak">0</span></div>
      <div class="st"><span class="k">平均用时</span><span class="v" id="sTime">—</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="meta" id="sMeta">正向 · 中等</div>

    <div class="card" id="card">
      <div class="qtype" id="qtype">百 分 数 → 分 母</div>
      <div class="q" id="q">—</div>
      <div class="sub" id="sub"></div>
      <div class="fb" id="fb"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="numrow" id="numRow">
      <button class="nk" type="button" data-k="1">1</button>
      <button class="nk" type="button" data-k="2">2</button>
      <button class="nk" type="button" data-k="3">3</button>
      <button class="nk" type="button" data-k="4">4</button>
      <button class="nk" type="button" data-k="5">5</button>
      <button class="nk" type="button" data-k="6">6</button>
      <button class="nk" type="button" data-k="7">7</button>
      <button class="nk" type="button" data-k="8">8</button>
      <button class="nk" type="button" data-k="9">9</button>
      <button class="nk" type="button" data-k="0">0</button>
      <button class="nk" type="button" data-k=".">.</button>
      <button class="nk fn" type="button" data-k="back">←</button>
    </div>

    <div class="actrow"><button id="btnGo" type="button">提交 (Enter)</button></div>

    <div class="toolbar">
      <button class="tbtn" id="btnTool" type="button">🧮 计算器 ⇄</button>
      <span class="thint">心里算不出来就点开，这个按钮在两种工具间切换</span>
    </div>

    <div class="tool" id="tool" hidden>
      <div class="tooltabs">
        <button class="tt on" type="button" data-t="calc">计算器</button>
        <button class="tt" type="button" data-t="pad">草稿纸</button>
        <span class="sp"></span>
        <button class="tt" id="btnToolClose" type="button">收起</button>
      </div>
      <div class="toolbody">
        <div id="paneCalc">
          <div class="cdisp">
            <input id="calcIn" type="text" inputmode="none" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" placeholder="345/1.14" />
            <div class="cout dim" id="calcOut">0</div>
          </div>
          <div class="keys" id="calcKeys">
            <button class="k fn" type="button" data-k="C">C</button>
            <button class="k fn" type="button" data-k="back">←</button>
            <button class="k fn" type="button" data-k="(">(</button>
            <button class="k fn" type="button" data-k=")">)</button>
            <button class="k" type="button" data-k="7">7</button>
            <button class="k" type="button" data-k="8">8</button>
            <button class="k" type="button" data-k="9">9</button>
            <button class="k op" type="button" data-k="÷">÷</button>
            <button class="k" type="button" data-k="4">4</button>
            <button class="k" type="button" data-k="5">5</button>
            <button class="k" type="button" data-k="6">6</button>
            <button class="k op" type="button" data-k="×">×</button>
            <button class="k" type="button" data-k="1">1</button>
            <button class="k" type="button" data-k="2">2</button>
            <button class="k" type="button" data-k="3">3</button>
            <button class="k op" type="button" data-k="−">−</button>
            <button class="k" type="button" data-k="0">0</button>
            <button class="k" type="button" data-k=".">.</button>
            <button class="k op" type="button" data-k="%">%</button>
            <button class="k op" type="button" data-k="+">+</button>
            <div class="eqrow">
              <button class="k eq" type="button" data-k="=">=</button>
              <button class="k send" id="calcSend" type="button" title="把计算结果填入答案并提交">提交答案</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div id="panePad" hidden>
          <div class="padbar">
            <button class="pbtn on" id="padPen" type="button">笔</button>
            <button class="pbtn" id="padErase" type="button">擦</button>
            <button class="pdot on" type="button" data-pen="1" aria-label="墨色"></button>
            <button class="pdot" type="button" data-pen="2" aria-label="橙色"></button>
            <button class="pdot" type="button" data-pen="3" aria-label="青色"></button>
            <button class="pbtn on" type="button" data-w="2.5">细</button>
            <button class="pbtn" type="button" data-w="5">粗</button>
            <span class="sp"></span>
            <button class="pbtn" id="padUndo" type="button">撤销</button>
            <button class="pbtn" id="padClear" type="button">清空</button>
          </div>
          <canvas id="pad"></canvas>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hist">
      <div class="histhead">
        <h2>最近答题 · 点一条可重做</h2>
        <div class="tools">
          <span class="cnt" id="hCount">0 条</span>
          <button id="btnClear" type="button">清空</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="histlist" id="histList"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="foot">
      <div>Δ = 现期 × r / (1+r) = 现期 ÷ (1 + 1/r)</div>
      <div>
        r = <code>1/n</code> 时，增长量 = 现期 ÷ <code>(n+1)</code>　·　反向估算：<code>百分数↑ → 分母↓</code>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 设置 -->
    <div class="modal" id="setModal" hidden>
      <div class="sheet">
        <div class="sheethead"><h2>设置</h2><button class="icon" id="setClose" type="button">完成</button></div>
        <p class="lead">
          随机出一个数，你要秒回它属于 <b>1/n</b>。答错会告诉你课件里的记忆法。<br />
          <b>简单</b>只出表里 1/2–1/20 三段（基础 / 进阶 / 高阶）和它们的倍数（2/3、3/8、7/10…）；<br />
          <b>中等</b>只出「一步能变形」的题：53% ← 5.3%、28.6% ← 2/7、249% ≈ 250%。
        </p>
        <div class="row">
          <span class="rowlabel">题型</span>
          <div class="chips" id="modeChips">
            <button class="chip on" type="button" data-m="fwd">% → 分母</button>
            <button class="chip" type="button" data-m="rev">分母 → %</button>
            <button class="chip" type="button" data-m="growth">增长量</button>
            <button class="chip" type="button" data-m="est">反向估算</button>
            <button class="chip" type="button" data-m="mixed">混合</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <span class="rowlabel">难度</span>
          <div class="chips" id="levelChips">
            <button class="chip" type="button" data-l="0">简单</button>
            <button class="chip on" type="button" data-l="1">中等</button>
            <button class="chip" type="button" data-l="2">困难</button>
          </div>
          <span class="lvnote" id="lvNote">表内值一步变形</span>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <span class="rowlabel">范围</span>
          <div class="chips" id="groupChips">
            <button class="chip on" type="button" data-g="basic">2–10 基础</button>
            <button class="chip on" type="button" data-g="mid">11–15 进阶</button>
            <button class="chip on" type="button" data-g="high">16–20 高阶</button>
            <button class="chip on" type="button" data-g="dec">小数分母</button>
            <button class="chip on" type="button" data-g="big">超 100%</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <span class="rowlabel">工具</span>
          <div class="chips">
            <button class="chip" id="btnTable2" type="button">1/n 百分表</button>
            <button class="chip" id="btnCalcQuick" type="button">计算器 / 草稿纸</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="snote">
          判定规则：分母题要与标准值相差 <b>不到 0.01</b> 才算对；百分数题容差 ±2%；增长量题按除数 ±0.01。<br />
          答题直接用题目下面那排小键盘，不会弹系统键盘；计算器算完点「提交答案」，结果会直接填进答案并提交。<br />
          手机上浏览器多半不支持真全屏，点「全屏」会收起站点页头页脚；想真全屏可以「添加到主屏幕」再打开。
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 1/n 表 -->
    <div class="modal" id="tblModal" hidden>
      <div class="sheet">
        <div class="sheethead"><h2>1/n 百分表</h2><button class="icon" id="tblClose" type="button">关闭</button></div>
        <div class="tblmode" id="tblMode">
          <button class="chip on" type="button" data-tm="easy">简单</button>
          <button class="chip" type="button" data-tm="all">全部</button>
        </div>
        <div id="tblBody"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style is:global>
  /* =========================================================
     百化分训练器：跟随站点的浅色 / 暗色主题
     ========================================================= */
  .bhf {
    --panel: #ffffff;
    --panel2: #f5f5f7;
    --key: #fbfbfc;
    --line: #e5e5e9;
    --txt: #141416;
    --dim: #6f6f78;
    --faint: #9a9aa2;
    --ok: #0f9d76;
    --bad: #e11d48;
    --accent: #6d28d9;
    --on-accent: #ffffff;
    --accent-weak: rgba(109, 40, 217, 0.08);
    --accent-line: rgba(109, 40, 217, 0.38);
    --send: #0f9d76;
    --on-send: #ffffff;
    --overlay: rgba(24, 24, 28, 0.38);
    --pad-bg: #ffffff;
    --pad-dot: #e3e3e9;
    --pen1: #1c1c1f;
    --pen2: #d97706;
    --pen3: #0d9488;
    color: var(--txt);
  }

  html.dark .bhf {
    --panel: #0e0e10;
    --panel2: #17171a;
    --key: #0b0b0d;
    --line: #2a2a30;
    --txt: #ececf1;
    --dim: #a0a0aa;
    --faint: #6f6f7a;
    --ok: #34d399;
    --bad: #fb7185;
    --accent: #a78bfa;
    --on-accent: #15101f;
    --accent-weak: rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.12);
    --accent-line: rgba(167, 139, 250, 0.4);
    --send: #2fd4a0;
    --on-send: #062a20;
    --overlay: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65);
    --pad-bg: #0b0b0d;
    --pad-dot: #232329;
    --pen1: #eaeaef;
    --pen2: #fbbf24;
    --pen3: #4ecdc4;
  }

  .bhf .bhf-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 14px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .bhf .bhf-kicker {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--faint);
  }

  .bhf .bhf-kicker a {
    border-bottom: none;
    color: var(--faint);
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .bhf .bhf-kicker a:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .bhf .bhf-title {
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    font-size: clamp(1.55rem, 5vw, 2rem);
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .bhf .lead {
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    max-width: 37rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--dim);
  }

  .bhf .lead b {
    color: var(--txt);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .bhf button {
    font-family: inherit;
    touch-action: manipulation;
  }

  /* ---------- 顶栏按钮 ---------- */
  .bhf .topacts {
    display: flex;
    gap: 6px;
    padding-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .bhf .icon {
    height: 34px;
    min-width: 34px;
    padding: 0 10px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--panel);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    color: var(--dim);
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: 0.15s;
  }

  .bhf .icon:hover {
    color: var(--txt);
    border-color: var(--accent-line);
  }

  .bhf .icon:active {
    transform: scale(0.96);
  }

  .bhf .icon.on {
    background: var(--accent-weak);
    border-color: var(--accent-line);
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  /* ---------- 统计 ---------- */
  .bhf .stats {
    display: flex;
    gap: 9px;
    margin: 0 0 9px;
  }

  .bhf .st {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
    padding: 8px 11px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: var(--panel);
  }

  .bhf .st .k {
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--faint);
  }

  .bhf .st .v {
    font-size: 16.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .bhf .meta {
    margin: 0 0 13px;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    color: var(--faint);
  }

  .bhf .meta b {
    color: var(--txt);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* ---------- 题目卡 ---------- */
  .bhf .card {
    position: relative;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 12px 14px 11px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: var(--panel);
    text-align: center;
    transition: border-color 0.18s, box-shadow 0.18s;
    box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03);
  }

  .bhf .card.ok {
    border-color: rgba(15, 157, 118, 0.5);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(15, 157, 118, 0.07);
  }

  html.dark .bhf .card.ok {
    border-color: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.55);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08);
  }

  .bhf .card.bad {
    border-color: rgba(225, 29, 72, 0.45);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(225, 29, 72, 0.06);
    animation: bhf-shake 0.32s;
  }

  html.dark .bhf .card.bad {
    border-color: rgba(251, 113, 133, 0.5);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(251, 113, 133, 0.07);
  }

  @keyframes bhf-shake {
    0%,
    100% {
      transform: translateX(0);
    }
    20% {
      transform: translateX(-7px);
    }
    40% {
      transform: translateX(6px);
    }
    60% {
      transform: translateX(-4px);
    }
    80% {
      transform: translateX(3px);
    }
  }

  .bhf .qtype {
    margin-bottom: 5px;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    color: var(--faint);
  }

  .bhf .q {
    margin-bottom: 5px;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 8vw, 44px);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.05;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    color: var(--txt);
  }

  .bhf .sub {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 8px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    min-height: 38px;
    font-size: clamp(17px, 4.6vw, 23px);
    color: var(--dim);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  .bhf .sub .small {
    font-size: 13.5px;
    color: var(--faint);
  }

  .bhf .sub .baseline {
    flex: 0 0 100%;
  }

  .bhf .sub input {
    width: 112px;
    padding: 4px 8px;
    border: 2px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 10px;
    outline: none;
    background: var(--key);
    color: var(--txt);
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: clamp(19px, 5vw, 24px);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-align: center;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    transition: border-color 0.15s, box-shadow 0.15s;
  }

  .bhf .sub input:focus,
  .bhf .sub input.active {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px var(--accent-weak);
  }

  .bhf .sub input::placeholder {
    color: var(--faint);
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .bhf .sub input.nudge {
    border-color: var(--bad);
    animation: bhf-shake 0.3s;
  }

  .bhf .optrow {
    flex: 0 0 100%;
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 460px;
    margin: 4px auto 0;
  }

  .bhf .opt {
    flex: 1;
    padding: 12px 8px;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: var(--panel2);
    color: var(--txt);
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.3;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: 0.15s;
  }

  .bhf .opt:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    background: var(--accent-weak);
  }

  .bhf .opt.right {
    border-color: var(--ok);
    background: rgba(15, 157, 118, 0.1);
    color: var(--ok);
  }

  html.dark .bhf .opt.right {
    background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.12);
  }

  .bhf .opt.wrong {
    border-color: var(--bad);
    background: rgba(225, 29, 72, 0.08);
    color: var(--bad);
  }

  html.dark .bhf .opt.wrong {
    background: rgba(251, 113, 133, 0.1);
  }

  .bhf .opt .kbd {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 4px;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--faint);
  }

  /* ---------- 反馈 ---------- */
  .bhf .fb {
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .bhf .fb:empty {
    display: none;
  }

  .bhf .fb .ok {
    color: var(--ok);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .bhf .fb .bad {
    color: var(--bad);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .bhf .fb .tip {
    display: inline-block;
    max-width: 100%;
    margin-top: 9px;
    padding: 9px 13px;
    border: 1px dashed var(--line);
    border-radius: 9px;
    background: var(--panel2);
    color: var(--dim);
    font-size: 12.5px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .bhf .fb .tip b {
    color: var(--txt);
  }

  .bhf .fb .tip em {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .bhf .fb .near {
    margin-top: 7px;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--faint);
  }

  /* ---------- 答题小键盘 ---------- */
  .bhf .numrow {
    display: flex;
    gap: 5px;
    margin: 10px auto 0;
    max-width: 440px;
  }

  .bhf .nk {
    flex: 1 1 0;
    min-width: 0;
    height: 44px;
    padding: 0;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: var(--panel2);
    color: var(--txt);
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    cursor: pointer;
    user-select: none;
    -webkit-user-select: none;
  }

  .bhf .nk:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent-line);
  }

  .bhf .nk:active {
    background: var(--accent-weak);
    transform: scale(0.95);
  }

  .bhf .nk.fn {
    color: var(--dim);
    font-size: 15px;
  }

  .bhf .numrow.off {
    opacity: 0.35;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .bhf .actrow {
    max-width: 440px;
    margin: 10px auto 0;
  }

  .bhf #btnGo {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 12px;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--on-accent);
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 15.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: filter 0.15s, transform 0.08s;
  }

  .bhf #btnGo:hover {
    filter: brightness(1.08);
  }

  .bhf #btnGo:active {
    transform: scale(0.99);
  }

  /* ---------- 历史 ---------- */
